   "mode": "Universal",
   "asset_reference_mode": "path_v2",
   "description": "Checkout time is over. The guests disagree. Finger Haunt is a single-player haunted hotel survival FPS with finger guns, furious ghosts and a very unreasonable checkout policy. Step into an illustrated 3D lobby and survive 20 increasingly crowded waves as the hotel's guests refuse to leave. Aim and fire at expressive enemies, dodge ranged attacks, and watch slimes split into smaller, faster pieces. Dash out of danger and time your cooldown-based jump to escape ground attacks. Choose four keepsakes from a pool of nine, improve your favorite upgrades, and earn separate boss powers as you dismiss the hotel's toughest holdouts. Four distinct boss fights lead to the furious Shrine Eye, the guests' final weapon. Expect falling chandeliers, a restless terrace audience and a comic story ending. Clear the campaign, then choose optional Endless mode if you want the hotel to keep fighting back. Play this browser ghost shooter with mouse and keyboard. Choose Relaxed, Standard or Nightmare difficulty, warm up in Practice, and see how long your build can survive. Cartoon horror, chaotic waves and rude hotel guests turn every checkout into a battle.",
